  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon is enduring an unprecedented situation due to the ongoing economic crisis and the COVID-19 pandemic. This has created additional barriers to employment with significant negative consequences on the livelihoods of PRS and PRL alike. To prevent further deterioration of the humanitarian situation of Palestine refugees in Lebanon, UNRWA will continue to provide its regular cash assistance to up to 301,400 PRS and PRL (exact caseload to be confirmed as the new digital ID verification system is rolled out).</narrative>
